ometric structure obtained by applying inverse stereographic projection to Pyth
agorean triples organized in the Berggren ternary tree. Each primitive Pythagor
ean triple (a, b, c) maps to a point on the unit circle S¹ via the rational par
ametrization (a/c, b/c), corresponding to a stereographic parameter t = a/(b+c)
