[]\T1/lmtt/m/n/12 2. **The Finite Domain Compilation Theorem** (formally verifi
ed): Any LLM operating over finite vocabularies *can* be represented as a singl
e matrix multiplication  but with astronomically large matrices (dimension ~502
57^1024 for GPT-2).[] 
 []


Overfull \hbox (1455.10805pt too wide) in paragraph at lines 32312--32312
[]\T1/lmtt/m/n/12 3. **The Tropical Compilation Framework** (novel): We prove t
hat ReLU networks are *exactly* tropical rational functions, and develop a trop
ical semiring compilation that preserves the network's piecewise-linear structu
re as a single operation in the (max, +) algebra. This is our most promising no
vel result.[] 
 []


Overfull \hbox (1319.25798pt too wide) in paragraph at lines 32314--32314
[]\T1/lmtt/m/n/12 4. **The Koopman Lifting Theorem** (novel): Using Koopman ope
rator theory, we show that the nonlinear transformer dynamics can be embedded i
nto an infinite-dimensional linear system, which can be truncated to yield fini
te-dimensional linear approximations with quantifiable error bounds.[] 
 []


