[]\T1/lmtt/m/n/12 *Evidence:* The Moufang loop structure allows "non-associativ
e interference"  different parenthesizations of the same gate sequence produce 
different outputs, creating C_{n-1} parallel computational paths. However, each
 individual path is still bounded by PSPACE (evaluating a single parenthesizati
