[]\T1/lmtt/m/n/12 We develop and formalize a "homing missile" algorithm for nav
igating the Berggren ternary tree of primitive Pythagorean triples toward targe
t rational points on the unit circle (equivalently, target states on the Bloch 
sphere equator). We define an exact integer-valued angular distance metric via 
cross-products, establish a compass based on the SternBrocot mediant structure 
of Euclid parameters, prove monotonic hypotenuse growth (ensuring convergence),
 and demonstrate exact overshoot correction via parent descent. All core theore
ms are machine-verified in Lean 4 + Mathlib with **zero** `sorry` statements. W
e also present computational experiments demonstrating factoring integers via t
argeted Berggren tree search.[] 
 []

