[]\T1/lmtt/m/n/12 The resolution lies in a fundamental asymmetry of adaptation.
 An attractor is a fixed target that cooperates with an adaptive searcher. A re
pulsor is an adaptive target that evades a fixed searcher. The question of who 
gets to adapt  the searcher or the target  determines whether the search proble
m is tractable or intractable.[] 
 []


