ability: during backpropagation, gradients can grow exponentially with depth, l
eading to *gradient explosion*. Standard mitigations  gradient clipping, batch 
normalization, weight decay, careful initialization schemes (Glorot, He, etc.) 
 are heuristic patches that address symptoms rather than the root cause.[] 
 []

